                <head>Agreements between the United States and Ethiopia</head>
                <p rendition="#center">AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE UNITED STATES AND ETHIOPIA CONCERNING A
                    HIGHWAY PROJECT</p>
                <p>[For text of Agreement effected by exchange of notes signed at Addis Ababa
                    February 26 and 27 and May 2, 1951, entered into force February 27, 1951, see 2
                    UST (pt. 2) 1704.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center">POINT FOUR GENERAL AGREEMENT FOR TECHNICAL COOPERATION
                    BETWEEN THE UNITED STATES AND ETHIOPIA</p>
                <p>[For text of Agreement signed at Addis Ababa June 16, 1951, entered into force on
                    that date, see 2 UST (pt. 2) 1227.]</p>
